TRANSCRIPT OF CLOSED CIRCUIT FOOTAGE
Location: Hotel Grand Palace, Aerocity. Date: 14 February 2024.

19:15 Camera 4. A dark sport utility vehicle bearing registration DL-04-E-5544 enters the forecourt. One male occupant leaves the vehicle and enters the lobby.
19:30 Camera 9. The same individual is seated at table 12 in the lounge with a second male. Hotel duty staff identified the two, on being shown the footage, as Vikram Malhotra and Amit Shahani. The identification rests on staff recognition and has not been independently confirmed by biometric means.
20:12 Camera 9. A tablet-sized device passes from the second individual to the first. The contents of the device are not visible on the footage.
20:45 Camera 4. The first individual leaves in the same vehicle.